<title>PERU: Peru's Q1 cotton output slips 24.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Peru's Q1 cotton output slips 24.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peru's first-quarter cotton production fell 24.8 percent to 23,776 tonnes from 31,604 tonnes in the same period last year, Agriculture Ministry said Wednesday.</p>
<p>Imports of cotton rose in the first quarter by 16.8 percent to $7.19 million, from $6.15 million in the same period of 1996.</p>
<p>((-- Andrew Cawthorne, Lima newsroom 511 221-2134))</p>
